        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Danieli asabila babaandu bewe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu mwiiko kwe khunyoa mu liamiia lia Dario, okhwa Ahuswero niye bamiia mu sibala sie Bakalidayo mu liamiia liewe lie khunyoa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.25.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer. 25.11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.29.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "29.10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ese Danieli, namenieelesia kaali mu bitabu bitakatifu mala khukhwama mu nibio namanyilisia sifuno sie likhuwa nilio Omwami Wele aaboolela omung'oosi Yeremia khuloondekhana nende kimiiko kamakhumi saba ekio, Khuloondekhana ne khukhwonakwa khwa Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio nasaba Omwami Wele mukhwikoonjelela namulilila, neyimana khulia, nefwara kamakunia, ne khukhwikhala mwikokhe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nasaba Omwami Wele, Wele wase ne khukhwiyama ndi:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ee Omwami Wele, ewe oli Wele Omukali lundi ooriisia. Oli omusuubilwa khu ndakaano yowo ne wekesianga busiime bwa ng'ali khwaabo babakhusiima ne khuloonda kamalaka kowo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Efwe khwakholile bubwoni lundi khwakholile kamabi. Khwabeele bamayaanu lundi khwabeele ne bureengu. Khwauukhe khukhwama khu malaka kowo ne lilakiilisia liowo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Se khwarekeeresia bakholi bowo bang'oosi, babalomaloma mu lisina liowo khu baami befwe, khu bakhulu befwe, khu bikuuka biefwe ne khu sibala siefwe sioosi tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buluungi buli lubeka lwowo, ee Omwami. Ne kakhali chisoni nga chiliio luno luri chili khwifwe, babaandu ba Yuda, bamenywa ba Yerusalemu, ne Isiraeli yoosi, ne nabo nibo ewe wasalanisia mu bibala bie aembi ne aleeyi khulwe khulekha khuuba basuubilwa khwiwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khwifwe Omwami Wele, kali likoyaana khu baami befwe, bakhulu befwe, bikuuka biefwe, sikila khwakhola kamabi ebweeni wowo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khwiwe Omwami Wele, kali siisa ne silekhelo, akhaba ne khwakhukholela kamabi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Se khwakhurekeeresia tawe, ee Omwami Wele wefwe, nga ne khukhaloonda kamalaka kowo niko wakhuelesia efwe khubirira mu bakholi bowo bang'oosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baisiraeli boosi bafunaka kamalaka kowo ne khuloba khukhurekeeresia. Silaamo ne sisiechubo bibiaandikwa mu lilaka lia Musa omukholi wa Wele, biakhwikholeekhekho, sikila khwakholile bubwoni khwiwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakholile koosi niko wakhukhalakila efwe ne babaami befwe, nga nilwo oukuumile lukoba lwa Yerusalemu burafu lukali khukhila lukoba luluundi lwosi lwosi khu sibala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ewe wakhuukuumile bulayi bwene nga ne kaandikwa mu malaka ka Musa, ne kakhali khukhwola luno, ee Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wefwe, se khwakhusabile okhubeele tawe. Se khwalekhile bubwoni bwefwe ne khukhwibaasia khu busuubilwa bwowo tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khwako ee Omwami Wele, Wele wefwe, waba werekeekhe khu khuukuuma efwe, mala wakhuukuuma, sikila buli lwoosi okholanga kaali kamaluungi, ne efwe se khwakhurekeeresia tawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ne siise sino, Omwami Wele wefwe, owarusia babaandu bowo khukhwama e Misiri mu bunyali bwowo bukali ne khukhola lisina liowo lieebwe luyali khukhwola luno. Khwakholile bumayaanu ne kamabi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ee Omwami, khulwe bikholwa biowo bia ng'ali okhaambwa ne lirima ne lukoba lwa Yerusalemu, ne sikulu siowo sitakatifu tawe. Ne sikila bumayaanu bwefwe nende kamabi ke bikuuka biefwe, Yerusalemu ne babaandu bowo babeele chisoni khu bibala biili siimbi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ee Wele wefwe, ulila lisaba lio omukholi wowo ne liliekoonjelela liewe. Nosiima ng'oona lundi Lukaangu lwowo nilwo bonaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ee Wele, khurekereesie mala obone butinyu bwefwe nende bwe lukoba lulaangwa mwisina liowo. Se khulikho khu khusaba sikila buluungi bwefwe tawe, ne kakhali khulikho khukhusaba khulwe siisa siowo sikali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ee Omwami Wele, khuulile! Ee Omwami Wele, khubeele! Omwami Wele, khurekereesie, lundi okhole! Okhakhiinda tawe, Omwami Wele, sikila lukoba ne babaandu bowo balaangwa mwisina liowo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Malaika Kaburieli enoosia bung'oosi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga naba ne saba, ne niyama bubwoni bwase ne bubwoni bwe babaandu base ba Isiraeli, ne khulilila Omwami Wele wase, khulwe sikulu sitakatifu sia Wele wase, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.1.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk. 1.19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.1.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Omundu Kaburieli oyo, niye nabona mu malola kamataayi, echa khangu niio naba. Siaba siise sie khuaana chimbosio akolooba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Echa mala amboolela ali, “Ee Danieli, ese nechile khuelesie bukesi ne liiulila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga warakikha khusaba Wele, akhukobosia. Nono nechile khukhuboolela likobosio. Sikila ewe oli omusiime lukali. Khwako rekeeresia bulayi mala omanye sifuno sie kamalola.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kimiiko kamakhumi saba khukhwola saba kiakhalaakwe khu baandu bowo ne sikulu siowo sitakatifu, khumalao kamakhiikha, khukhwakamia bubwoni, khubeela bumayaanu, khureera buluungi bwa mindali, khuura kumuuri khu malola ne bung'oosi, ne khuakha kamafura Abuundu Atakatifu Lukali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.24",
