              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khwako manya mala omanye bulayi likhuwa lino: Khukhwama siise nisio lilaka likharusibwe khukhwombakhwa lundi lukoba lwa Yerusalemu khukhwola khukhwicha khwo murobore owa Wele owaakhwa kamafura, silibao siise sie kamachuuma saba. Khu siise sie kamachuuma kamakhumi sita na kibili, lukoba lwa Yerusalemu luliombakhwa lundi ne chingila ne lisiisi lie kamaani, ne kakhali siise esio sikhabe sie butinyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio enyuma we kamachuuma kamakhumi sita na kabili ako, owaakhwa kamafura oyo akheerwe ne se akhabekho na sioosi tawe. Babaandu bo mwami wicha balionaka lukoba ne abuundu atakatifu. Ekhumaliilikha khwayo khulibao ne kameechi kamakali, liie ne lilionaka nilio Wele arekekha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.26"
            ]
          }
        },
